{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1e46c7babe57c385f3e05ea82fddb23a231e58b05785f188b02f413b87e471d6", "ja": "（トゥインクルリズムのリバイバル公演も、\nもうすぐ開演。ところで、亜利沙はどこに……？）", "zh": "（Twinkle Rhythm的复出演出也马上就要开始了。话说回来，亜利沙去哪儿了……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "b2beea493c0fd1a8c547ad9b56eb9434a807516c8e4fc8890ce2465c96c32eec", "ja": "ムフフッ。この可愛らしい表情の育ちゃんは、\nやっぱり天使ですね。はぅ～、癒されますぅ～。", "zh": "嘿嘿。这副可爱的表情，小育果然就是天使呢。哈呜～被治愈了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6c80d210f276f9f423626c995930e6f298195203af9f746f4a3f6030d49a5ec3", "ja": "何してるんだ、亜利沙？", "zh": "你在做什么呢，亚利沙？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "1c15fb212afd7c4d34280150c9fc3e2189434badf390d2029ee4010d433eee21", "ja": "ハッ！　ありさ、やましいことは何もしてませんよ！\n本番前にドリームパワーを補充してただけなんです！", "zh": "哈！亚利沙什么亏心事都没做哦！\n只是在正式演出前补充梦想的力量而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1004_p", "source_sha256": "0771ed0c6a5c9286a0cdae7ebe79d4f3a314a5e43a23652e290c33666aa5458a", "ja": "そうか……。\nまた隠れてアイドル達の写真でも撮ったのか？", "zh": "这样啊……\n你又躲起来偷拍偶像们的照片了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "1dd1068da4a119f19c23244a0e9d008051385fe82594b874b9401dbdbea8c0b9", "ja": "いえ、そっちはまだ整理が……じゃなくて！\n今見てたのは、トゥインクルリズムのフォルダです。", "zh": "不是，那边的照片还没整理好……不对，不是这个！我刚才看的是Twinkle Rhythm的文件夹。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1006_028ari", "source_sha256": "fe9ec44f2d6f397172dfdd83d351fd52f2bef751e1fb951435ea92d938805f83", "ja": "前の撮影の時のとか……ありさ達の\n思い出が詰まった、お宝写真の宝庫なんですよぉ。", "zh": "像之前拍摄时的照片之类的……这里可是充满了亚利沙她们回忆的珍贵照片宝库哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1007_p", "source_sha256": "1ab2cbe9a0eb3b0c004fa4e650472be666728bdea277229f27cb186ca71a5e8a", "ja": "なるほど、それは確かにお宝だな。\n本番の撮影、3人ですごく頑張ってくれたもんな。", "zh": "原来如此，确实是宝贝啊。  \n正式拍摄时，3人都非常努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "30bfb3ddbd77cf2b1de1e7b9a68bd5f3d19d1e985b88b5d1a1ab17e0c4963c1c", "ja": "はい。育ちゃんと百合子ちゃんと……あとは、\nたくさんの人が応援してくれたおかげで頑張れました！", "zh": "是的。育和百合子……还有，多亏了很多人的支持，我才能努力到现在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "4abd0e27a794fef264e5398b93043ff65a4dd31fbf901765f5ebe7fd104aaca2", "ja": "放送の実況する人や、ありさ達の曲に合わせて\nダンス動画をアップしてくれる人もいて。", "zh": "还有人为节目做实时解说，也有人配合亚利沙她们的歌曲上传舞蹈视频。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "26d1554d32a50e6c48bd08774ed56cb3c4ee7421f1943afbddcd4e8b1f10e450", "ja": "ファンの人達の推し活がとっても力になりました！\n今日のライブで、少しでもお返しできたらいいなって。", "zh": "粉丝们的追星活动给了我们很大的力量！\n要是能在今天的演唱会上多少回馈一点就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1011_p", "source_sha256": "250a504a76889f647bf1aa4ced1f0baf883745b60c63878419160efe1c0545ad", "ja": "そうだな。感謝の気持ちをたくさん伝えてきてくれ。\nそれは亜利沙にしか出来ない事だ。", "zh": "是啊。把满满的感谢之情传达给大家吧。\n那是只有亚利沙才能做到的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1012_p", "source_sha256": "2bdc4b9ced76e588e166ae3cee38621007ae9a83aa408cd8a5c4278bcb358c84", "ja": "そうそう、俺も亜利沙には感謝してるんだ。\n提供してくれたオフショット、好評だったからな。", "zh": "对对，我也很感谢亚利沙。\n你提供的那些幕后照片，反响很不错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1013_028ari", "source_sha256": "5ffced145857211b2ddf65ede8772fa73de13303cd074811e11187e38f0e2a4a", "ja": "か、感謝とかそんな……。\nありさは自分にできることをしたまでで、えへへっ。", "zh": "感、感谢什么的……  \n亚利沙只是做了自己能做的事而已，嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1014_p", "source_sha256": "219b2d2dd9c8e68e6b697dafe9719a4fc94024520f7d6ee919cf6edaa3a5fbbf", "ja": "ただ……前は亜利沙が全然写ってなくて、バランスが\n悪かったからな。今度は、俺が亜利沙を撮るよ。", "zh": "不过……之前的照片里完全没有拍到亚利沙，画面不太平衡。这次就由我来给亚利沙拍吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "4dd8b0c819a601171c0a24bf19cc9d103758df549a149b57035364d36a0b3f75", "ja": "へえー、そうなんですね。\n{$P$}さんがありさを……えっ？", "zh": "诶——原来是这样啊。\n{$P$}先生要给亚利沙拍照……诶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_1016", "source_sha256": "7eafa8e7ec19d173b452c691ef3d300286e3c15a801aaf4d6afbffad25b35d34", "ja": "写真を撮る", "zh": "拍照", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_2000_null", "source_sha256": "282d76390fceecf1886b50d83b67408a8f313ad4a314baab4a59021708dc0da4", "ja": "パシャッ、パシャパシャ……", "zh": "咔嚓、咔嚓咔嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_2001_028ari", "source_sha256": "a572bac34c2effbe8e41b60e6934d60051a496edef08eb7e1b37fb95fcac0fc3", "ja": "ええーっ！？　あ、ありさのことはおかまいなく！\nま、待ってください……やぁ～んっ！", "zh": "诶诶——！？啊、请不用管我这个亚利沙！\n等、等一下……呀——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_028ari0273_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_028ari0273_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c9b1f47cefa2f768a7e435204eda16bfd5e926de6be88980136b834a510c662c", "ja": "あっ……逃がさないぞ、トゥインクルアリサ！\nパシャパシャパシャ……。", "zh": "啊……别想逃，闪耀亚利沙！\n咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
